category: Libs
requires: girepository-GLib2.0 libglib2.0-devel libmirage12
sdesc: "CD-ROM image access library (GObject Introspection data)"
ldesc: "libMirage is a CD-ROM image access library. It is written in C and based on
GLib. It's aim is to provide uniform access to the data stored in various
image formats."
external-source: libmirage

